<title>UK: Commonwealth finance ministers to meet Sept 25/26.</title>
<headline>Commonwealth finance ministers to meet Sept 25/26.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finance ministers from Commonwealth countries will meet in Bermuda on September 25 and 26 to prepare for the annual meetings of the International Monetary Fund and World Bank the following week, the Commonwealth Secretariat said.</p>
<p>They will discuss issues including multilateral debt and money laundering, as well as this year's special theme -- &quot;Private capital flows and development: the role of national and international policies.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom 44 171 542 2774</p>
